{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00592","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第三章 · 沈佺期","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第三章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙池跃龙龙已飞，龙德[光]天天不违。\n池开天汉分黄道，龙向天门入紫微。\n邸第楼台多气色，君王凫雁有光辉。\n爲报寰中百川水，来朝此地莫东归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}